key and  joining either the axis or the Allies  barring some future guarantees turkeys  joining of the war stem not from wanting  to get involved but from fear of being  sidelined by the international community  after the war had ended I hope you  enjoyed this episode and thank you for  watching with extra thanks to my patrons  that you see on screen now and a special  thanks to James Bissonnette party-boy co  Zarqa flash chris wicker Rob Waterhouse  Michael Reynolds Gustav Swan  Maggie packs Kowski Winston k-word  rafail Adam Harvey Anthony Beckett Skye  Chappell and the amusement park Ives  you
 

